              "value": "Two dark brown beach umbrellas and matching sun loungers on pristine white sand overlooking a calm turquoise sea, with palm trees and a clear blue sky in the background."
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Embrace the tranquility of coastal bliss under the warm sun"
            }
          ]
        },
